  "rationale": "Adds dependency caching via actions/cache@v4 for the Nix store (/nix/store) in the two flake-based jobs, keyed on flake.lock. This matches the P-LIT-GHA-CACHE pattern (dependency_cache mechanism), which has measured evidence of CI savings from caching dependency download state. The cache is placed after Nix installation so /nix/store exists before restore, and before Nix commands so repeated runs can reuse previously fetched/evaluated store paths. The nix-legacy job is intentionally left uncached because it tracks the mutable nixpkgs-unstable channel, which falls under the pattern's mutable/untrusted cached content contraindication. All existing build and test steps are preserved unchanged.",
